          skills21stCentury: "Creativity and Innovation\nGenerating original musical ideas and expressing them through melody and lyrics.\n\nCritical Thinking\nApplying knowledge of pitch, rhythm, form, and phrasing to build a well-structured melody.\n\nCommunication\nUsing music and text as expressive tools to communicate meaning, emotion, or narrative.\n\nDigital Literacy\nUsing music notation or recording tools to present the final composition professionally.",
